  "description": "For serious riders who want a serious spec! The Tract 3 is for those who need the best, designed for those who crave excitement, demand peak performance, and ride hard.\nEngineered from rugged 6061 alloy, the Tract 3 eats trails for breakfast. From the box it’s ready to shred and equipped to be fast. The upgraded Suntour coil fork with 100mm of travel, 15mm through axle, and adjustable damping delivers an ultra confident riding experience.\nTurn heads effortlessly with wide alloy handlebar, 50mm stem, and a semi-integrated headset, providing not just control but an injection of style into your trail conquests. Grip, rip, and slide like a boss with double walled rims, 2.3” trail-ready tires, and Tektro hydraulic disc brakes for immense stopping power.\nTop end trail ready shifting is standard on the Tract 3 thanks to Shimano’s 12 speed Deore groupset with clutch derailleur and shadow tech, matched to a precision-engineered narrow wide crankset with oversized axle and external bottom bracket. Chain drop and slap are a thing of the past. This is a groupset that won’t let you down.\nFinishing kit is handpicked by Reid to compliment and complete the build, lock on grips, trail ready saddle, and lightweight alloy seatpost. Black is the new black here and the Tract looks awesome for it.\nThe Tract 3 is your ride for pushing your boundaries time and time again. Built to perform, built to last, built for fun. Take your off roading to the next level!",
